  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Grease a 9x13 inch baking dish with olive oil.",
    "In a large bowl, combine sliced potatoes, chopped tomatoes, and minced garlic.",
    "Mix in wholesome breadcrumbs and casserole cheese blend until well combined.",
    "Transfer the potato mixture to the prepared baking dish.",
    "Cover the dish with aluminum foil and bake for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove foil and continue baking for an additional 20-25 minutes, or until the potatoes are tender and golden brown.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Let the casserole rest for 10-15 minutes before serving."
